                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "32282900",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197995718130",
                            "num_reviews": 31,
                            "playtime_forever": 80,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 70,
                            "last_played": 1497102824
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a refreshing change from all the other clone VR games being released daily.\n\nIt's simple and intuitive to control, uses 360 room scale very nicely, imagine playing snake inside of an Omni theater but also include the bottom half of your view, a full 360 dome...now that doesn't sound very cool but you know in VR, simple sounding things are more impressive in VR. \n\nThe graphics are clean and slick, the audio is very, very well done, a lot like Racket NX (I'm playing with the deluxe audio head strap), and the gameplay is easy to pick up but challenging as you progress.\n\nIf you enjoyed the arcade ship shooter in The Lab, you're gonna really like this game, it's very much taking a classic arcade title/genre and bringing it to the present through VR - not a remake but a re-imagining of what made 80's arcade games so much fun to come back to.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1496982141,
